  "description": "This is the stadium rock of dinners: On lead guitar, we have corn (what a sweetie!), frittering away. The crunchy golden fritters are laying down riffs like you would not believe. On bass, rocket keeps you humming along in style (plus, he's a bit of a health freak). Finally, bringing up the rhythm section is our HelloFresh guacamole. Full of flavour and funk, this guy really knows how to party. Rock on!",
